**GPL Agents** have the whole known universe to police. Their
all-business manner has started rumors that they're robots, or
at least genetically engineered clones. The GPL says otherwise.

Attributes: Attack +2 (Stun Baton) [Perks: Paralyzing; Flaws: Ineffective, Low Penetration], Combat Expert +1, Evasive +1, Perceptive +1; Emotionless −1, Servitude −2 (GPL).

